1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,900
《大逃亡》
The Great Escape

2
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:06,008
油门在哪？
Where's the gas pedal?

3
00:00:06,008 --> 00:00:07,985
再试一次，老兄。走啊，走啊。
Try it again, man. Go, man, go.

4
00:00:07,985 --> 00:00:09,210
去按那个大红按钮。
Go push the big red button.

5
00:00:09,210 --> 00:00:10,105
发动它！
Get it started!

6
00:00:10,105 --> 00:00:11,000
后面怎么了？
What's going on back there?

7
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:11,950
你个晕头转向的混蛋！
Dizzy prick!

8
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:12,610
弄错了？
Doing it wrong?

9
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:15,960
哦。
Oh.

10
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:20,333
操！逮住他们，老兄。干掉他们。别让他们跑了
Oh, shit! Get them, man. Fuck them up. Don't let them get away,

11
00:00:20,833 --> 00:00:23,433
你们这帮人，惹错墨西哥人了。
You guys. Fuck with the wrong Mexicans.

12
00:00:27,003 --> 00:00:28,500
把这玩意儿启动起来，士兵。
Get this thing started, soldier.

13
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:30,300
……宝贝，发动它，爸爸！
…baby, start it, daddy!

14
00:00:32,950 --> 00:00:34,709
你个臭园丁！我撤了！
You leaf blower! I'm out!

15
00:00:34,789 --> 00:00:39,050
装弹！我要把这些脑袋都干了——你用不着胳膊！
Reloading. I'll drink these heads, you don't need arms!

16
00:00:41,666 --> 00:00:44,633
天哪，我发誓，发动这玩意儿，我就再也不碰它了。
God, I promise, start this thing and I'll never see it again.

17
00:00:47,891 --> 00:00:52,950
对！走！快走！
Yeah! Go! Move it!

18
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,440
对，现在看我还服不服？
Yeah, how you like me now?

19
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:04,000
下集预告，《你们这帮婊子》
Next time on Why You Bitches!

20
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,000
好耶！
Booyah!

21
00:01:19,578 --> 00:01:25,766
糟了，这不对啊。得掉头。
Uh-oh, that ain't right. Gotta turn around.

22
00:02:18,910 --> 00:02:21,229
闪开，把这该死的门打开。
Get out of the way, open the damn door.

23
00:02:24,390 --> 00:02:26,865
闻着像豆子呕吐物拌金枪鱼焗饭！
Stinks like a bean vomit tuna fish casserole!

24
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:28,920
呸，好大的味儿。
Phew, what a pong.

25
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,433
这不对劲！
That ain't right!

26
00:02:37,720 --> 00:02:38,770
什么东西，老兄？
What is it, man?

27
00:02:43,910 --> 00:02:45,833
老天爷。
Jesus Cristo!

28
00:03:00,950 --> 00:03:02,337
Damn fish,
该死的鱼

29
00:03:02,337 --> 00:03:06,500
我早知道我们没法跟那些滑溜溜的叛徒和平共处。
I knew we could never coexist peacefully with those slippery traitors.

30
00:03:06,500 --> 00:03:08,100
到夏威夷了吗？
Are we in Hawaii yet?

31
00:03:08,849 --> 00:03:09,183
不！
No!

32
00:03:09,609 --> 00:03:10,566
靠，姑娘！
Damn, girl!

33
00:03:11,423 --> 00:03:14,733
他们肯定得烧了学校，才能让你从二年级毕业！
They must have burned your school down just to get you out of second grade!

